## Directory Structure

```
wiki/
├── CLAUDE.md              ← this file
├── index.md               ← you maintain
├── log.md                 ← you maintain
├── backlog.md             ← human adds ideas; you remove completed items on ingest
├── scratch/               ← human writes freely during work; you read on ingest
<!-- CUSTOMIZE: list your content category directories and what each contains -->
├── concepts/              ← you maintain; cross-cutting ideas across all units
└── synthesis/             ← you create on demand when a query answer is worth keeping
```

