## Naming Conventions

- All directories and filenames: kebab-case
- Scratch files: `<unit-id>-<content-type>.md`
  <!-- CUSTOMIZE: specify the unit-id format, e.g., week-01-2026-01-05 -->
- Unit-scoped pages: `<unit-id>.md`
- Subject-scoped pages: named by subject only, no unit identifier
- Never overwrite a subject-scoped page with unrelated content — create a distinctly named new page instead

---

## Query Behavior

When the human asks a question against the wiki:

1. Read `index.md` to identify the most relevant pages
2. Read those pages in full
3. Synthesize a clear answer with citations (link to specific pages)
4. If the answer represents a useful analysis, comparison, or pattern worth keeping, offer to file it as a `synthesis/` page

